          This portal is used by Sunrise Public School staff, students and parents to manage
          and view admission details, fee payments, marks, bus routes and complaints.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-reveal"><a href="/login" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg px-4 fw-semibold">Sign in to the portal</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

